    {"s": 26, "t": "Exam Schedule", "p": "🗓️ <b>26. Upload Institute Exam Schedule (Dates).</b>\n<i>Send a PDF or Image. Click Skip if none.</i>", "type": "btn", "o": ["⏭ Skip"]}
